<title>USA: Diamond Home Services files stock offer.</title>
<headline>Diamond Home Services files stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>WOODSTOCK, Ill. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond Home Services Inc said it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of 750,000 shares.</p>
<p>In a statement issued August 28, Diamond Home said all of the shares are being offered by a shareholder, Globe Building Materials Inc.</p>
<p>There will be no underwriter over-allotment option.</p>
<p>William Blair &amp; Co will manage the underwriting group for the offering.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
